---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Interactive Fiction — Adam Dolin" description="Twine games and other interactive narratives by Adam Dolin.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/work" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Work</a>

      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Writing Samples</span>
        <h1>Interactive</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">Interactive narratives in multiple formats.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mini-fiction card">
        <div data-passage="start">
          <p class="passage-prompt">What would you like to play?</p>
          <div class="choice-list">
            <button class="choice" data-goto="quests">YouTube videos of quests I wrote</button>
            <button class="choice" data-goto="twine">A Twine game I wrote for my class</button>
            <button class="choice" data-goto="netflix">Stranger Things: Face the Dark</button>
            <button class="choice" data-goto="values">A values quiz I designed</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="quests" class="is-hidden">
          <p class="nda-note">Due to NDAs, I can't share actual scripts from the games I've worked on publicly — but here are links to playthroughs of some of the quests I wrote. Hover over each for the story behind it.</p>
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <a href="https://youtu.be/YENEb4YEVxg?si=Fb9ArZAqiPj6Ptlq&t=63" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-title">
              <strong>God of War (2018)</strong> — The Anatomy of Hope
            </a>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>My favorite script I wrote for a God of War (2018) side quest. Kratos and Atreus' dialog during these boat conversations was directly influenced by my own experience of losing my father to cancer during the game's development in 2016. This quest holds a special place in my heart.</p>
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLw8qrSr2ZYiSDdfOhBMdmaUqhIAnlzzEk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Playlist of all other God of War side quests</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W32Y-kBS3uo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-title">
              <strong>God of War Ragnar&ouml;k</strong> — The Song of the Sands
            </a>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>I'm particularly proud of this quest chain. With two potential companions (Atreus or Freya) across two different areas, this quest remains one of the most difficult I've ever written, both in terms of its logical complexity and ensuring that each version was equally compelling. The final script for this mission ended up around 70 pages.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="twine" class="is-hidden">
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <a href="/work/goblin-atelier" class="entry-title">
              <strong>The Goblin Atelier of Waterdeep</strong>
            </a>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>A brief Twine adventure, in the style of Baldur's Gate 3. Used as a teaching example to help students learn Twine.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/work/goblin-atelier" class="entry-cta">Enter it &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="netflix" class="is-hidden">
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <a href="https://www.netflix.com/house/experiences/stranger-things" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-title">
              <strong>Stranger Things: Face the Dark</strong>
            </a>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>I consulted on narrative and game design for this escape room at Netflix House in Dallas.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.netflix.com/house/experiences/stranger-things" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Learn more &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="values" class="is-hidden">
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <a href="https://whataremycorevalues.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-title">
              <strong>WhatAreMyCoreValues.org</strong>
            </a>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>An interactive values exploration tool — a quiz that helps you discover and rank your core values.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://whataremycorevalues.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Take the quiz &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.choice').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = btn.dataset.goto;
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-passage]').forEach((p) => {
        p.classList.toggle('is-hidden', p.dataset.passage !== target);
      });
    });

    // Feed the cursor's horizontal position to CSS as --mx (0–100%)
    // so the sunset gradient and glow can follow the mouse
    btn.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
      const rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();
      const x = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 100;
      btn.style.setProperty('--mx', `${x}%`);
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .mini-fiction {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* A low sun cresting the top-right corner: its center sits on the
     corner itself, so only a quarter of the disc is ever visible.
     Hidden until the card is hovered, then it rises in. */
  .mini-fiction::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -240px;
    right: -240px;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle closest-side,
      rgba(240, 208, 160, 0.85),
      rgba(232, 184, 152, 0.5) 12%,
      rgba(232, 160, 112, 0.3) 30%,
      rgba(216, 136, 120, 0.15) 52%,
      rgba(127, 181, 201, 0.06) 70%,
      transparent 78%
    );
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .mini-fiction:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .is-hidden {
    display: none;
  }

  .passage-prompt {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .choice-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .choice {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  /* Sunset band along the top border — slides with the cursor (--mx),
     so blues rise on the left and corals on the right */
  .choice::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--color-blue),
      var(--color-sage),
      var(--color-gold),
      var(--color-accent),
      var(--color-coral),
      var(--color-peach)
    );
    background-size: 300% 100%;
    background-position: var(--mx, 50%) 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Soft warm glow pooled under the cursor, like light off a cold brew */
  .choice::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(
      140px 70px at var(--mx, 50%) 0%,
      rgba(232, 160, 112, 0.28),
      rgba(216, 136, 120, 0.12) 45%,
      transparent 75%
    );
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-base);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .choice:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .choice:hover::before,
  .choice:hover::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .choice-back {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-color: var(--color-text-muted);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .choice-back:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .nda-note {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .fiction-entry {
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .entry-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .entry-title:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Context is collapsed by default and revealed on hover (or keyboard focus) */
  .entry-context {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height var(--transition-base), opacity var(--transition-base);
  }

  .fiction-entry:hover .entry-context,
  .fiction-entry:focus-within .entry-context {
    max-height: 400px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .entry-context p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .entry-context a {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .entry-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
